block_00302={
{"text"},
text={
vo={
{"vo",file="fem_rna_002871",ch="rna"},
},
ja={
{
name={"Rina"},
"“Está bien, Naoya-san. *kyup*, *kyup*, *chup*. Ngh, fuh... Eyacula, bastante...\nngh, fuh... ngh, fuh... *rerorero*... echa, todo, todo tu semen... sobre,\nmí...”",
